# Battle against Volcanion (steam and fire): a snare and a pulsing synth building pressure, then a C-minor trumpet
# line in clipped bursts over brass stabs, the pulse never letting go. Original composition for this game.
title Battle! Volcanion
tempo 172
meter 4/4
lowhptempo 1.07
reverb 0.22

